<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow in the panhandle area late Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported limited inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 900 slaughter steers and 500 heifers following the weekly movement of 137,300 head.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1075-1150 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:  1,400    Week Ago:  1,700     Year Ago:  6,800</p>
